<!doctype html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>HYPE PRODUCTION | Cinematic Video Studio</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@700;800;900&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <script>
    /* Early mobile + format-mode detection — runs before first paint.
       Sets one of: show-chooser | mode-landing | mode-multipage | mode-cinematic
       Mobile devices skip the chooser entirely and always get cinematic mobile. */
    (function(){
      try {
        var html = document.documentElement;
        var isPhone = window.matchMedia('(max-width: 720px)').matches
                   || (window.matchMedia('(pointer: coarse)').matches && window.matchMedia('(max-width: 900px)').matches);
        if (isPhone) html.classList.add('is-mobile-view');

        var params = new URLSearchParams(location.search);
        var mode = params.get('mode');
        var VALID = ['landing','multipage','cinematic'];

        if (isPhone) {
          // Mobile = always cinematic mobile experience. Never show chooser.
          html.classList.add('mode-cinematic');
        } else if (VALID.indexOf(mode) >= 0) {
          html.classList.add('mode-' + mode);
        } else {
          // Desktop, no mode chosen yet — show the full-screen chooser.
          html.classList.add('show-chooser');
        }
      } catch(e) {}
    })();
  </script>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #02040a; --bg-soft: #080d16; --text: #f8fbff; --muted: #9aa8ba;
      --line: rgba(167, 230, 255, 0.18); --line-strong: rgba(167, 230, 255, 0.42);
      --blue: #6ee7ff; --violet: #9b8cff; --champagne: #d9c8a9; --gold: #ffcd6e;
      --radius: 8px;
      --safe-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);
      --safe-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html, body { margin: 0; background: #000; color: var(--text); font-family: "Manrope", sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; overflow-x: hidden; scroll-behavior: smooth; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
    body { overscroll-behavior-y: none; }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    button, input, textarea { font: inherit; }
    img, video { max-width: 100%; height: auto; }
    .scene-canvas-wrap { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; }
    #three-canvas { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
    /* Subtle vignette overlay above 3D for legibility of text */
    .vignette { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 5; pointer-events: none; background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(0,0,0,0) 40%, rgba(0,0,0,0.55) 100%); }
    .portal-flash { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 30; background: #fff; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; mix-blend-mode: screen; }
    .scroll-progress { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; z-index: 90; width: 0; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--blue), var(--violet)); box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(110, 231, 255, 0.6); }
    .site-header { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 80; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: calc(14px + var(--safe-top)) clamp(14px, 4vw, 56px) 14px; background: rgba(2, 4, 10, 0.55); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); gap: 10px; }
    .brand { font-family: "Inter", sans-serif; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 0.18em; font-size: 13px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap; }
    .brand .dot { color: var(--blue); }
    .scene-counter { font-family: "Inter", sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 800; }
    .scene-counter .now { color: var(--blue); }
    .header-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
    .lang-switcher { display: flex; gap: 2px; padding: 3px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); }
    .lang-switcher button { min-width: 34px; height: 26px; border: 0; border-radius: 5px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.08em; background: transparent; cursor: pointer; transition: color .2s, background .2s; }
    .lang-switcher button.active { color: #02040a; background: var(--blue); }
    .lang-switcher button:not(.active):hover { color: var(--text); }
    .header-cta { padding: 8px 16px; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: var(--radius); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; transition: background .2s, color .2s; }
    .header-cta:hover { background: var(--blue); color: #02040a; }
    main { position: relative; z-index: 10; pointer-events: none; }
    .stage { position: relative; min-height: 100vh; min-height: 100dvh; display: flex; align-items: center; pointer-events: none; }
    .stage-inner { width: 100%; max-width: 1500px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 clamp(20px, 6vw, 80px); opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease; pointer-events: auto; }
    .stage.in .stage-inner { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    .stage-eyebrow { color: var(--blue); letter-spacing: 0.24em; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 16px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .stage-eyebrow .num { padding: 4px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(110, 231, 255, 0.06); font-family: "Inter", sans-serif; }
    .stage h2 { font-family: "Inter", sans-serif; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 0.92; margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: clamp(40px, 8vw, 120px); text-shadow: 0 2px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.55); }
    .stage h2.med { font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 72px); }
    .stage p.lead { color: var(--text); font-size: clamp(15px, 1.4vw, 19px); line-height: 1.55; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 0 22px; opacity: 0.86; text-shadow: 0 1px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); }
    .gradient { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--blue), var(--violet)); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; }
    .stage.left .stage-inner { text-align: left; }
    .stage.right .stage-inner { text-align: right; }
    .stage.center .stage-inner { text-align: center; }
    .stage.bottom { align-items: flex-end; padding-bottom: 12vh; }
    .hero-stats { margin-top: 36px; display: flex; gap: 36px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .hero-stats > div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
    .hero-stats strong { font-family: "Inter", sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(22px, 2.4vw, 32px); color: var(--blue); }
    .hero-stats span { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
    .scroll-hint { position: fixed; bottom: calc(20px + var(--safe-bottom)); left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); z-index: 70; color: var(--muted); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; animation: pulse 2.4s infinite; transition: opacity 0.5s ease; pointer-events: none; white-space: nowrap; }
    .scroll-hint.hidden { opacity: 0; }
    .scroll-hint::before { content: ""; width: 28px; height: 1px; background: var(--blue); }
    @keyframes pulse { 0%, 100% { opacity: 0.4; } 50% { opacity: 0.95; } }
    .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; padding: 13px 24px; border-radius: var(--radius); font-family: "Inter", sans-serif; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid transparent; transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none; }
    .btn.primary { background: var(--blue); color: #02040a; box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(110, 231, 255, 0.28); }
    .btn.primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(110, 231, 255, 0.42); }
    .btn.ghost { border-color: var(--line-strong); color: var(--text); background: rgba(2, 4, 10, 0.4); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px); }
    .btn.ghost:hover { background: rgba(110, 231, 255, 0.08); }
    .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 8px 0 0; }
    .panel { display: inline-block; padding: 24px 28px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(8, 13, 22, 0.6); backdrop-filter: blur(14px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px); max-width: 600px; }
    .panel p { color: var(--muted); margin: 0; line-height: 1.55; font-size: 15px; }
    .pricing-labels { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; max-width: 900px; margin-top: 22px; }
    .pl-card { padding: 16px 20px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(8, 13, 22, 0.65); backdrop-filter: blur(14px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px); text-align: center; transition: transform .2s, border-color .2s; }
    .pl-card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: var(--line-strong); }
    .pl-card .pl-tier { font-family: "Inter", sans-serif; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 0.18em; font-size: 11px; margin: 0 0 6px; }
    .pl-card .pl-name { font-family: "Inter", sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .pl-card .pl-price { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; margin: 0; }
    .pl-card.start .pl-tier { color: var(--blue); }
    .pl-card.growth .pl-tier { color: var(--violet); }
    .pl-card.hype .pl-tier { color: var(--gold); }
    .contact-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 50px; max-width: 1200px; align-items: start; }
    .contact-links { margin-top: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
    .contact-links a { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 16px 20px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(8, 13, 22, 0.6); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px); transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s, transform 0.2s; }
    .contact-links a:hover { border-color: var(--line-strong); background: rgba(110, 231, 255, 0.06); transform: translateX(4px); }
    .contact-links span { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
    .contact-links strong { font-family: "Inter", sans-serif; font-size: 15px; }
    .contact-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; padding: 28px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(8, 13, 22, 0.78); backdrop-filter: blur(18px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px); }
    .contact-form label { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 800; }
    .contact-form input, .contact-form textarea { padding: 13px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(2, 4, 10, 0.6); color: var(--text); font-size: 16px; font-family: "Manrope", sans-serif; transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s; }
    .contact-form textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 100px; }
    .contact-form input:focus, .contact-form textarea:focus { outline: 0; border-color: var(--blue); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(110, 231, 255, 0.18); }
    .form-status { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; min-height: 16px; }
    .loading { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 200; background: #000; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; transition: opacity 0.6s ease; padding: 20px; }
    .loading.gone { opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }
    .loading .l-brand { font-family: "Inter", sans-serif; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 0.3em; font-size: 14px; text-align: center; }
    .loading .l-dot { color: var(--blue); }
    .loading .l-bar { width: min(220px, 70vw); height: 1px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
    .loading .l-bar::after { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; height: 100%; width: 40%; background: var(--blue); animation: loadingBar 1.4s infinite ease-in-out; }
    @keyframes loadingBar { 0%, 100% { transform: translateX(-100%); } 50% { transform: translateX(250%); } }

    /* ============= TABLET ============= */
    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 30px; }
      .stage h2 { font-size: clamp(38px, 9vw, 84px); }
      .stage h2.med { font-size: clamp(30px, 6.5vw, 60px); }
      .hero-stats { gap: 24px; }
    }

    /* ============= MOBILE ============= */
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .scene-counter { display: none; }
      .site-header { padding: calc(10px + var(--safe-top)) 14px 10px; }
      .brand { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; }
      .header-cta { display: none; }
      .lang-switcher button { min-width: 32px; height: 28px; font-size: 11px; }
      .stage { min-height: 100vh; min-height: 100dvh; }
      .stage-inner { padding: 80px 22px 60px; }
      .stage.bottom { padding-bottom: 10vh; }
      .stage.bottom .stage-inner { padding-bottom: 0; }
      /* Force center alignment on mobile so text never collides with the 3D scene edges */
      .stage.left .stage-inner,
      .stage.right .stage-inner { text-align: left; }
      .stage h2 { font-size: clamp(34px, 10vw, 64px); line-height: 0.96; margin: 0 0 14px; }
      .stage h2.med { font-size: clamp(28px, 8vw, 48px); }
      .stage-eyebrow { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; margin: 0 0 12px; }
      .stage-eyebrow .num { padding: 3px 8px; font-size: 10px; }
      .stage p.lead { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; max-width: 100%; margin: 0 0 18px; }
      .stage.right .stage-eyebrow,
      .stage.right .stage p.lead,
      .stage.right .hero-actions { justify-content: flex-start !important; margin-left: 0 !important; text-align: left; }
      .stage.right .panel { margin-left: 0 !important; }
      .hero-stats { gap: 18px 24px; margin-top: 28px; }
      .hero-stats strong { font-size: 22px; }
      .hero-stats span { font-size: 9px; }
      .hero-actions { gap: 10px; }
      .btn { padding: 14px 22px; font-size: 12px; flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 140px; }
      .pricing-labels { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-top: 18px; }
      .pl-card { padding: 14px 18px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; text-align: left; gap: 12px; }
      .pl-card .pl-tier { margin: 0; flex: 0 0 auto; }
      .pl-card .pl-name { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; flex: 1; }
      .pl-card .pl-price { font-size: 12px; flex: 0 0 auto; }
      .contact-form { padding: 20px; }
      .contact-links a { padding: 14px 16px; }
      .contact-links strong { font-size: 14px; }
      .panel { padding: 18px 20px; max-width: 100%; }
      .panel p { font-size: 14px; }
      .scroll-hint { font-size: 9px; bottom: calc(14px + var(--safe-bottom)); }
      .scroll-hint::before { width: 20px; }
      /* Slightly dim the 3D layer on phones so text always reads */
      .vignette { background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(0,0,0,0.15) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.55) 100%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(2,4,10,0.35) 0%, rgba(2,4,10,0.05) 30%, rgba(2,4,10,0.05) 70%, rgba(2,4,10,0.45) 100%); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 380px) {
      .brand { font-size: 10px; }
      .stage h2 { font-size: 36px; }
      .stage h2.med { font-size: 30px; }
      .lang-switcher button { min-width: 28px; }
    }

    /* Landscape phones: keep things compact */
    @media (max-height: 480px) and (orientation: landscape) {
      .stage-inner { padding: 70px 32px 40px; }
      .stage h2 { font-size: clamp(28px, 6vw, 56px); }
      .stage h2.med { font-size: clamp(22px, 4.5vw, 40px); }
      .hero-stats { margin-top: 18px; gap: 22px; }
    }

    /* Reduce motion */
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .stage-inner { transition: none; }
      .scroll-hint { animation: none; }
    }

    /* ============================================================
       MOBILE OVERRIDE LAYER — replaces desktop on phones,
       does NOT touch any desktop styles or scripts.
       Activates when <html> has class "is-mobile-view"
       (set by inline script when matchMedia(max-width: 720px) matches).
       ============================================================ */
    #mobile-root { display: none; }

    html.is-mobile-view, html.is-mobile-view body {
      overflow: hidden;
      height: 100%;
      background: #000;
      overscroll-behavior: none;
    }
    html.is-mobile-view .site-header,
    html.is-mobile-view main,
    html.is-mobile-view .scene-canvas-wrap,
    html.is-mobile-view .vignette,
    html.is-mobile-view .scroll-hint,
    html.is-mobile-view .scroll-progress,
    html.is-mobile-view .portal-flash,
    html.is-mobile-view #loading { display: none !important; }

    html.is-mobile-view #mobile-root {
      display: block;
      position: fixed; inset: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: "Manrope", sans-serif;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      background: #000;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    /* ---------- header ---------- */
    .m-header {
      position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: calc(16px + var(--safe-top)) 18px 12px;
      z-index: 30;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .m-brand {
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif; font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1.15; pointer-events: auto;
    }
    .m-brand .l1 { display: block; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; }
    .m-brand .l2 { display: block; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.28em; color: #6ee7ff; opacity: 0.9; margin-top: 2px; }

    .m-menu-btn {
      position: relative;
      width: 38px; height: 38px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 9px;
      background: rgba(2,4,10,0.55);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      cursor: pointer;
      pointer-events: auto;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .m-menu-btn::before, .m-menu-btn::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%;
      width: 16px; height: 1.2px;
      background: var(--text);
      transition: transform 0.25s ease, opacity 0.2s ease;
    }
    .m-menu-btn::before { transform: translate(-50%, calc(-50% - 4px)); }
    .m-menu-btn::after  { transform: translate(-50%, calc(-50% + 4px)); }
    html.menu-open .m-menu-btn::before { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(45deg); }
    html.menu-open .m-menu-btn::after  { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-45deg); }

    /* ---------- scroll container & scenes ---------- */
    .m-scroll {
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      overflow-y: auto;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      scroll-snap-type: y mandatory;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    }
    .m-scene {
      height: 100vh;
      height: 100dvh;
      scroll-snap-align: start;
      scroll-snap-stop: always;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      isolation: isolate;
    }

    /* ---------- corridor background (real photos, CSS fallback) ---------- */
    .m-bg {
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      background: #000 center / cover no-repeat;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    /* Per-scene corridor photos. Missing files just fall back to schematic. */
    .m-scene[data-stage="0"]  .m-bg { background-image: url('assets/corridors/corridor-01-entrance.jpg'); }
    .m-scene[data-stage="1"]  .m-bg { background-image: url('assets/corridors/corridor-02-nav-hub.jpg'); }
    .m-scene[data-stage="2"]  .m-bg { background-image: url('assets/corridors/corridor-03-commercial.jpg'); }
    .m-scene[data-stage="3"]  .m-bg { background-image: url('assets/corridors/corridor-04-ai-video.jpg'); }
    .m-scene[data-stage="4"]  .m-bg { background-image: url('assets/corridors/corridor-04-ai-video.jpg'); }   /* REELS reuses AI VIDEO + violet overlay */
    .m-scene[data-stage="5"]  .m-bg { background-image: url('assets/corridors/corridor-05-brand-films.jpg'); }
    .m-scene[data-stage="6"]  .m-bg { background-image: url('assets/corridors/corridor-06-visual-polish.jpg'); }
    .m-scene[data-stage="7"]  .m-bg { background-image: url('assets/corridors/corridor-07-ai-sites.jpg'); }
    .m-scene[data-stage="8"]  .m-bg { background-image: url('assets/corridors/corridor-08-automations.jpg'); }
    .m-scene[data-stage="9"]  .m-bg { background-image: url('assets/corridors/corridor-09-systems.jpg'); }
    .m-scene[data-stage="10"] .m-bg { background-image: url('assets/corridors/corridor-10-final-zone.jpg'); }
    .m-scene[data-stage="11"] .m-bg { background-image: url('assets/corridors/corridor-01-entrance.jpg'); }   /* LAUNCH reuses ENTRANCE + gold overlay */

    /* Once we confirm the first photo loaded, hide the CSS schematic
       (SVG corridor, light pillar, figure) so the photo reads cleanly.
       If photos missing → class never gets added → schematic stays visible. */
    html.photos-loaded .m-corridor,
    html.photos-loaded .m-pillar,
    html.photos-loaded .m-figure { display: none !important; }

    /* Subtle dark wash on top of every photo so titles always read. */
    html.photos-loaded .m-bg::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 100% 60% at 50% 100%, rgba(0,0,0,0.70), transparent 55%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.10) 0%, transparent 25%, transparent 60%, rgba(0,0,0,0.45) 100%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    /* REELS — violet wash over the AI VIDEO corridor */
    html.photos-loaded .m-scene[data-stage="4"] .m-bg::before {
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 110% 80% at 50% 45%, rgba(190,130,255,0.55), transparent 65%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 100% 60% at 50% 100%, rgba(50,10,80,0.75), transparent 55%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(80,40,150,0.30) 0%, transparent 25%, transparent 60%, rgba(0,0,0,0.50) 100%);
    }

    /* LAUNCH — bright gold wash over the ENTRANCE corridor */
    html.photos-loaded .m-scene[data-stage="11"] .m-bg::before {
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 100% 70% at 50% 45%, rgba(255,210,120,0.70), transparent 70%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 100% 60% at 50% 100%, rgba(60,40,10,0.65), transparent 55%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,180,80,0.20) 0%, transparent 25%, transparent 60%, rgba(0,0,0,0.45) 100%);
    }
    /* radial glow */
    .m-bg::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 50% at 50% 42%, var(--m-glow, rgba(110,231,255,0.32)) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 60%);
    }
    /* vignette + floor */
    .m-bg::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 100% 60% at 50% 100%, rgba(0,0,0,0.7), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 110% 90% at 50% 50%, transparent 30%, rgba(0,0,0,0.55) 75%, #000 100%);
    }
    /* converging perspective lines (corridor floor/ceiling) */
    .m-corridor {
      position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .m-corridor svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }
    .m-corridor .line { stroke: var(--m-line, rgba(110,231,255,0.45)); stroke-width: 1; fill: none; opacity: 0.6; }
    .m-corridor .line.glow { stroke-width: 2; opacity: 0.35; filter: blur(2px); }

    /* light pillar at center */
    .m-pillar {
      position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 8%; bottom: 18%;
      width: 4px; transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, var(--m-pillar, rgba(110,231,255,0.85)) 45%, transparent 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 0 60px 18px var(--m-pillar-glow, rgba(110,231,255,0.55));
      filter: blur(0.5px);
      opacity: 0.95;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .m-pillar::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%;
      width: 120px; height: 120px;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--m-pillar-glow, rgba(110,231,255,0.6)) 0%, transparent 70%);
      filter: blur(8px);
    }
    /* tiny silhouette of a person at bottom (only on hero) */
    .m-figure {
      position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 22%;
      width: 8px; height: 28px;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1a2030 0%, #050810 100%);
      border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
      opacity: 0.9;
    }
    .m-figure::after {
      content: ""; position: absolute; left: 50%; top: -6px;
      width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: #0a0f1a; transform: translateX(-50%);
    }

    /* color presets per scene */
    .m-scene[data-tone="blue"]   { --m-glow: rgba(110,231,255,0.32); --m-line: rgba(110,231,255,0.45); --m-pillar: rgba(110,231,255,0.85); --m-pillar-glow: rgba(110,231,255,0.55); }
    .m-scene[data-tone="violet"] { --m-glow: rgba(155,140,255,0.38); --m-line: rgba(184,150,255,0.42); --m-pillar: rgba(190,140,255,0.9);  --m-pillar-glow: rgba(155,100,255,0.55); }
    .m-scene[data-tone="magenta"]{ --m-glow: rgba(216,110,255,0.42); --m-line: rgba(220,140,255,0.4);  --m-pillar: rgba(230,120,255,0.9);  --m-pillar-glow: rgba(200,90,230,0.55); }
    .m-scene[data-tone="gold"]   { --m-glow: rgba(255,205,110,0.38); --m-line: rgba(255,205,150,0.4);  --m-pillar: rgba(255,205,110,0.9);  --m-pillar-glow: rgba(255,180,80,0.55); }
    .m-scene[data-tone="warm"]   { --m-glow: rgba(255,170,90,0.32);  --m-line: rgba(255,190,150,0.35); --m-pillar: rgba(255,200,140,0.9);  --m-pillar-glow: rgba(255,170,90,0.55); }
    .m-scene[data-tone="cyan"]   { --m-glow: rgba(120,255,230,0.32); --m-line: rgba(120,255,230,0.4);  --m-pillar: rgba(120,255,230,0.9);  --m-pillar-glow: rgba(120,255,230,0.55); }

    /* ---------- scene content ---------- */
    .m-scene .m-content {
      position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
      padding: 0 24px calc(110px + var(--safe-bottom));
      z-index: 5;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .m-scene .m-idx {
      position: absolute; top: calc(84px + var(--safe-top)); left: 22px;
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif; font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.24em;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
      z-index: 8;
    }
    .m-scene .m-eyebrow {
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.32em; font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 8px;
    }
    .m-scene .m-title {
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      font-size: clamp(22px, 6.4vw, 30px);
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      text-shadow: 0 2px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.75);
      line-height: 1.05;
    }
    .m-scene .m-desc {
      font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78);
      max-width: 320px; margin: 0 auto;
      text-shadow: 0 1px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
    }

    /* ---------- bottom counter + progress ---------- */
    .m-bottom {
      position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0;
      bottom: calc(28px + var(--safe-bottom));
      padding: 0 22px;
      z-index: 14;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .m-bottom .row {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; font-weight: 800;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .m-bottom .row .now span { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); }
    .m-bottom .bar {
      position: relative;
      height: 2px; border-radius: 2px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.10);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .m-bottom .bar .fill {
      position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; height: 100%;
      width: 0%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffcd6e, #d9c8a9);
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(255,205,110,0.55);
      transition: width 0.4s ease;
      border-radius: 2px;
    }

    /* ---------- vertical side dots ---------- */
    .m-dots {
      position: absolute; right: 10px; top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;
      z-index: 14;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .m-dots i {
      width: 4px; height: 4px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
      transition: background 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
    }
    .m-dots i.active { background: #ffcd6e; transform: scale(1.6); box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255,205,110,0.7); }

    /* ---------- bottom CTA (floating) ---------- */
    .m-fab {
      position: fixed; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
      bottom: calc(74px + var(--safe-bottom));
      z-index: 20;
      pointer-events: auto;
      display: none;
    }
    html.is-mobile-view .m-fab { display: inline-flex; }
    .m-fab button {
      padding: 12px 22px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffcd6e, #d9c8a9);
      color: #02040a;
      border: 0; border-radius: 10px;
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(255,205,110,0.35);
    }

    /* ---------- menu drawer ---------- */
    .m-menu-panel {
      position: fixed; inset: 0;
      background: rgba(2,4,10,0.95);
      backdrop-filter: blur(30px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(30px);
      z-index: 200;
      transform: translateX(100%);
      transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(.5,.05,.2,1);
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      padding: calc(70px + var(--safe-top)) 26px calc(28px + var(--safe-bottom));
    }
    html.menu-open .m-menu-panel { transform: translateX(0); }
    .m-menu-panel ul {
      list-style: none; margin: 8px 0 0; padding: 0;
      flex: 1;
    }
    .m-menu-panel li button {
      background: 0; border: 0; color: var(--text);
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 22px 0; width: 100%;
      text-align: left;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .m-menu-panel li button:active { color: var(--blue); }
    .m-menu-panel .m-menu-cta {
      margin-top: 22px;
      padding: 16px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffcd6e, #d9c8a9);
      color: #02040a;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase;
      border: 0; cursor: pointer;
    }
    .m-menu-panel .m-lang-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 14px; }
    .m-menu-panel .m-lang-row button {
      flex: 1; padding: 12px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 7px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .m-menu-panel .m-lang-row button.active { background: var(--blue); color: #02040a; border-color: var(--blue); }

    /* ---------- contact bottom sheet ---------- */
    .m-sheet {
      position: fixed; inset: 0;
      z-index: 210;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      display: flex; align-items: flex-end;
      opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    }
    html.sheet-open .m-sheet { opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }
    .m-sheet-card {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      background: #0a0f1a;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 22px 22px 0 0;
      padding: 26px 22px calc(28px + var(--safe-bottom));
      max-height: 88vh; overflow-y: auto;
      transform: translateY(100%);
      transition: transform 0.36s cubic-bezier(.5,.05,.2,1);
    }
    html.sheet-open .m-sheet-card { transform: translateY(0); }
    .m-sheet-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 6px;
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900;
    }
    .m-sheet-card .sub { margin: 0 0 18px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
    .m-sheet-close {
      position: absolute; top: 14px; right: 14px;
      width: 36px; height: 36px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 16px;
      display: grid; place-items: center;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .m-sheet form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; margin: 0; }
    .m-sheet input, .m-sheet textarea {
      padding: 14px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 10px;
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 16px;
      font-family: "Manrope", sans-serif;
    }
    .m-sheet textarea { min-height: 96px; resize: vertical; }
    .m-sheet input:focus, .m-sheet textarea:focus { outline: 0; border-color: var(--blue); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(110,231,255,0.18); }
    .m-sheet button[type=submit] {
      padding: 16px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffcd6e, #d9c8a9);
      color: #02040a;
      border: 0; border-radius: 10px;
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .m-sheet .m-form-status { margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); min-height: 16px; }
    .m-sheet .m-contact-links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin-top: 18px; }
    .m-sheet .m-contact-links a {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
      color: var(--text);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .m-sheet .m-contact-links span { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.24em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
    .m-sheet .m-contact-links strong { font-family: "Inter", sans-serif; font-size: 14px; }

    /* ---------- stats grid on final scene ---------- */
    .m-scene .m-stats {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 8px; margin: 18px auto 0; max-width: 340px;
    }
    .m-scene .m-stats .stat {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 10px 6px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    }
    .m-scene .m-stats .stat strong {
      display: block;
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      font-weight: 900; font-size: 18px;
      color: #ffcd6e;
    }
    .m-scene .m-stats .stat span {
      font-size: 8.5px; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* fade-in scene content as it becomes active */
    .m-scene .m-content { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(14px); transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease; }
    .m-scene.active .m-content { opacity: 1; transform: none; }

    /* tiny initial scroll hint chevron */
    .m-scroll-hint {
      position: absolute; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
      bottom: calc(64px + var(--safe-bottom));
      z-index: 12;
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.36em;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      animation: m-pulse 2.2s infinite ease-in-out;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .m-scene:not([data-stage="0"]) .m-scroll-hint { display: none; }
    @keyframes m-pulse { 0%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; transform: translate(-50%, 0); } 50% { opacity: 0.85; transform: translate(-50%, 6px); } }

    @media (max-width: 360px) {
      .m-menu-panel li button { font-size: 19px; padding: 18px 0; }
      .m-scene .m-title { font-size: 22px; }
    }

    /* ============================================================
       CHOOSER — full-screen entry with three format tiles.
       Visible only when <html.show-chooser> is set (desktop, no ?mode= param).
       Mobile devices and direct-link visitors (?mode=cinematic etc) skip it.
       ============================================================ */
    #chooser-root { display: none; }
    html.show-chooser #chooser-root {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      position: fixed; inset: 0;
      z-index: 500;
      background: #000;
      padding: 40px 24px;
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    /* Hide everything else when chooser is up */
    html.show-chooser .site-header,
    html.show-chooser main,
    html.show-chooser .scene-canvas-wrap,
    html.show-chooser .vignette,
    html.show-chooser .scroll-hint,
    html.show-chooser .scroll-progress,
    html.show-chooser .portal-flash,
    html.show-chooser #loading,
    html.show-chooser #mobile-root { display: none !important; }
    html.show-chooser, html.show-chooser body { overflow: hidden; background: #000; }

    .ch-brand {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 38px;
    }
    .ch-brand .ch-logo {
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif; font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.36em;
    }
    .ch-brand .ch-logo .accent { color: var(--blue); }
    .ch-brand .ch-tag {
      margin-top: 14px;
      font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.4em; font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .ch-tiles {
      display: flex; gap: 22px;
      width: 100%; max-width: 920px;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
    .ch-tile {
      position: relative;
      flex: 1; min-width: 0;
      aspect-ratio: 9/14;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0a0d14, #05070c);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.10);
      border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform .28s ease, border-color .28s ease, box-shadow .28s ease, opacity .28s ease;
    }
    .ch-tile:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
    }
    .ch-tiles:hover .ch-tile:not(:hover) {
      opacity: 0.45;
    }
    .ch-tile[data-target="landing"]:hover    { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(255,255,255,0.10); }
    .ch-tile[data-target="multipage"]:hover  { border-color: rgba(110,231,255,0.50); box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(110,231,255,0.18); }
    .ch-tile[data-target="cinematic"]:hover  { border-color: rgba(255,205,110,0.55); box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(255,205,110,0.22); }

    .ch-tile .ch-preview {
      position: absolute; inset: 8px 8px 78px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .ch-tile .ch-label {
      position: absolute; left: 14px; right: 14px; bottom: 14px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .ch-tile .ch-name {
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif; font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.28em;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .ch-tile .ch-sub {
      margin-top: 6px;
      font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .ch-tile[data-target="cinematic"] .ch-name { color: var(--gold); }
    .ch-tile[data-target="cinematic"] .ch-sub  { color: rgba(255,205,110,0.7); }

    /* ----- LANDING preview (light mini-page scrolling) ----- */
    .ch-prev-landing {
      width: 100%; height: 100%;
      background: #f6f7fb;
      padding: 10px 8px;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
    }
    .ch-prev-landing .l-head { font-size: 6px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; font-weight: 900; color: #02040a; }
    .ch-prev-landing .l-title { font-size: 9px; font-weight: 900; color: #02040a; line-height: 1.0; }
    .ch-prev-landing .l-row { background: #eceef3; height: 12px; border-radius: 2px; }
    .ch-prev-landing .l-row.short { height: 6px; width: 70%; }
    .ch-prev-landing .l-cta { margin-top: auto; background: #02040a; color: #fff; text-align: center; font-size: 5.5px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; padding: 4px; border-radius: 3px; font-weight: 800; }

    /* ----- MULTIPAGE preview (dark, with sticky nav + grid) ----- */
    .ch-prev-multipage {
      width: 100%; height: 100%;
      background: #0a0e16;
      padding: 6px;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px;
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
    }
    .ch-prev-multipage .m-nav {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      padding-bottom: 4px; border-bottom: 0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      font-size: 4.5px; color: #fff; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    }
    .ch-prev-multipage .m-nav .links { display: flex; gap: 5px; font-weight: 700; }
    .ch-prev-multipage .m-nav .links span { color: #9aa8ba; }
    .ch-prev-multipage .m-nav .links span.on { color: #6ee7ff; }
    .ch-prev-multipage .m-hero {
      flex: 1.2;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #182030, #0a0e16);
      border-radius: 3px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      color: #6ee7ff; font-size: 5px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; font-weight: 800;
    }
    .ch-prev-multipage .m-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3px;
    }
    .ch-prev-multipage .m-grid div { background: #11161f; height: 14px; border-radius: 2px; }
    .ch-prev-multipage .m-foot {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 4px; color: #5d6878; letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    }

    /* ----- CINEMATIC preview (corridor SVG) ----- */
    .ch-prev-cinematic {
      width: 100%; height: 100%;
      background: #000;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .ch-prev-cinematic svg { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
    .ch-prev-cinematic .glow {
      position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%;
      width: 50%; height: 20%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(255,205,110,0.55), transparent 70%);
      filter: blur(3px);
    }
    .ch-prev-cinematic .label {
      position: absolute; left: 8px; bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 4.5px; color: #ffcd6e; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    }

    .ch-footer {
      margin-top: 36px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.32em; font-weight: 700;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* ============================================================
       LANDING MODE — fast, minimal, conversion-focused.
       One scrollable page, no scene counter, sticky bottom CTA.
       Feel: SaaS landing page.
       ============================================================ */
    html.mode-landing .scene-canvas-wrap,
    html.mode-landing .vignette,
    html.mode-landing .scroll-hint,
    html.mode-landing .portal-flash,
    html.mode-landing .scene-counter,
    html.mode-landing .lang-switcher,
    html.mode-landing #loading { display: none !important; }
    html.mode-landing { background: #06080e; }
    html.mode-landing body { background: #06080e; }
    html.mode-landing main {
      background: #06080e;
      padding-bottom: 80px; /* room for sticky CTA */
    }
    /* Minimal slimmer header */
    html.mode-landing .site-header {
      background: rgba(6,8,14,0.85);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      padding-top: calc(10px + var(--safe-top));
      padding-bottom: 10px;
    }
    html.mode-landing .brand { font-size: 12px; }
    html.mode-landing .header-cta {
      background: var(--blue); color: #02040a; border-color: var(--blue);
      padding: 9px 18px;
    }
    /* Tight section flow — no full viewport per section */
    html.mode-landing .stage {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 60px 0;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    html.mode-landing .stage.bottom { padding-bottom: 60px; align-items: flex-start; }
    html.mode-landing .stage-inner { opacity: 1; transform: none; max-width: 980px; }
    html.mode-landing .stage h2 { font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 56px); }
    html.mode-landing .stage h2.med { font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 42px); }
    html.mode-landing .hero-stats { gap: 32px; }
    /* Sticky bottom "Обсудить проект" CTA bar */
    .landing-cta {
      display: none;
      position: fixed; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
      z-index: 70;
      background: rgba(6,8,14,0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      padding: 14px clamp(20px, 4vw, 40px);
      align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;
    }
    html.mode-landing .landing-cta { display: flex; }
    .landing-cta .lc-text {
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text);
      font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
    .landing-cta .lc-text small {
      display: block; font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 3px;
    }
    .landing-cta .lc-btn {
      background: var(--blue); color: #02040a;
      padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 8px;
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif; font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(110,231,255,0.25);
      transition: transform .15s;
    }
    .landing-cta .lc-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }

    /* ============================================================
       MULTIPAGE MODE — section-as-pages, sticky top navigation,
       page numbers, pronounced section dividers.
       Feel: traditional brand website with multiple destinations.
       ============================================================ */
    html.mode-multipage .scene-canvas-wrap,
    html.mode-multipage .vignette,
    html.mode-multipage .portal-flash,
    html.mode-multipage .scroll-hint,
    html.mode-multipage #loading { display: none !important; }
    html.mode-multipage { background: #02040a; }
    html.mode-multipage body { background: #02040a; }
    html.mode-multipage main {
      background: #02040a;
      padding-top: 56px; /* room for the multipage nav strip */
    }
    /* Header keeps lang switcher; scene counter hidden, replaced by page number */
    html.mode-multipage .scene-counter { display: none; }
    /* Multipage navigation strip — second row under main header */
    .mp-nav {
      display: none;
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      z-index: 75;
      background: rgba(2,4,10,0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: calc(56px + var(--safe-top)) clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px) 12px;
      align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 36px;
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    html.mode-multipage .mp-nav { display: flex; }
    .mp-nav a {
      color: var(--muted);
      padding: 6px 2px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
      transition: color .2s, border-color .2s;
    }
    .mp-nav a:hover { color: var(--text); }
    .mp-nav a.active { color: var(--blue); border-bottom-color: var(--blue); }
    html.mode-multipage main { padding-top: 100px; }

    /* Each stage = a distinct "page" with strong visual separation */
    html.mode-multipage .stage {
      min-height: 90vh;
      padding: 100px 0;
      position: relative;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    html.mode-multipage .stage:last-of-type { border-bottom: 0; }
    html.mode-multipage .stage-inner { opacity: 1; transform: none; max-width: 1200px; }
    html.mode-multipage .stage h2 { font-size: clamp(40px, 7vw, 88px); }
    html.mode-multipage .stage h2.med { font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 64px); }
    /* Alternating section backgrounds for "page" feel */
    html.mode-multipage .stage:nth-of-type(odd) {
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 40% at 20% 50%, rgba(110,231,255,0.04), transparent 70%);
    }
    html.mode-multipage .stage:nth-of-type(even) {
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 40% at 80% 50%, rgba(155,140,255,0.04), transparent 70%);
    }
    /* Page-number badge in top-right of each section */
    html.mode-multipage .stage::before {
      content: attr(data-stage);
      position: absolute;
      top: 32px; right: clamp(20px, 6vw, 80px);
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.32em; font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    html.mode-multipage .stage::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 50px; right: clamp(20px, 6vw, 80px);
      width: 60px; height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--blue));
    }

    /* "← change format" floating link, visible in all chosen modes */
    .ch-switch {
      position: fixed; right: 18px; bottom: calc(18px + var(--safe-bottom));
      z-index: 90;
      padding: 9px 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(2,4,10,0.65);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: color .2s, border-color .2s, background .2s;
      display: none;
    }
    .ch-switch:hover { color: var(--text); border-color: var(--line-strong); background: rgba(110,231,255,0.06); }
    html.mode-landing .ch-switch,
    html.mode-multipage .ch-switch,
    html.mode-cinematic .ch-switch { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
    html.is-mobile-view .ch-switch { display: none !important; }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .ch-tiles { flex-direction: column; max-width: 380px; }
      .ch-tile { aspect-ratio: 16/8; max-height: 130px; }
      .ch-tile .ch-preview { inset: 8px 8px 56px; }
      .ch-brand { margin-bottom: 24px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div style="position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;">
    <video id="v-hero" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/hero-video.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-promo" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/promo-video.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-cyber" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/cyber-punk-video.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-ugc" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/ugc-blogger-content.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-cinematic" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/cinematic-reels.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-action" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/action-video.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-motion" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/hyper-motion-product-video.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-extra1" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/extra-1.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-extra2" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/extra-2.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-extra3" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/extra-3.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-extra4" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/extra-4.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-user01" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/user-video-01.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-user02" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/user-video-02.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-user03" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/user-video-03.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-user04" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/user-video-04.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-user05" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/user-video-05.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-user06" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/user-video-06.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-user07" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/user-video-07.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-user08" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/user-video-08.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-user09" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/user-video-09.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-user10" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/user-video-10.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-user11" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/user-video-11.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-user12" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/user-video-12.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-user13" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/user-video-13.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-user14" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/user-video-14.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-user15" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/user-video-15.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-user16" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/user-video-16.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-user17" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/user-video-17.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-user18" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/user-video-18.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
    <video id="v-user19" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="assets/user-video-19.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
  </div>

  <div class="loading" id="loading">
    <div class="l-brand"><span class="l-dot">▍</span> HYPE PRODUCTION</div>
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.32em;color:#6ee7ff;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:800;">Cinematic Video Studio</p>
    <div class="l-bar" id="lBar"></div>
    <button id="enterBtn" type="button" style="margin-top:18px;padding:14px 28px;border:1px solid #6ee7ff;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(110,231,255,0.06);color:#6ee7ff;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.2em;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;display:none;transition:background .2s, transform .2s;">ENTER THE STUDIO →</button>
    <p id="lStatus" style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.22em;color:#9aa8ba;text-transform:uppercase;text-align:center;">Loading videos...</p>
  </div>

  <div class="scroll-progress"></div>
  <div class="portal-flash" id="portalFlash"></div>

  <!-- ============================================================
       CHOOSER — full-screen entry, only visible when <html.show-chooser>
       ============================================================ -->
  <div id="chooser-root">
    <div class="ch-brand">
      <div class="ch-logo"><span class="accent">▍</span> HYPE PRODUCTION</div>
      <div class="ch-tag">выбери формат · какой сайт твой</div>
    </div>

    <div class="ch-tiles">
      <!-- LANDING -->
      <div class="ch-tile" data-target="landing" onclick="window.location.search='?mode=landing'">
        <div class="ch-preview">
          <div class="ch-prev-landing">
            <div class="l-head">HYPE</div>
            <div class="l-title">Cinematic<br/>AI Studio</div>
            <div class="l-row"></div>
            <div class="l-row short"></div>
            <div class="l-row"></div>
            <div class="l-row short"></div>
            <div class="l-cta">ОТПРАВИТЬ ЗАЯВКУ</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ch-label">
          <div class="ch-name">LANDING</div>
          <div class="ch-sub">одностраничный · быстрый</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- MULTIPAGE -->
      <div class="ch-tile" data-target="multipage" onclick="window.location.search='?mode=multipage'">
        <div class="ch-preview">
          <div class="ch-prev-multipage">
            <div class="m-nav">
              <span>HYPE</span>
              <span class="links"><span>WORKS</span><span>ABOUT</span><span class="on">CONTACT</span></span>
            </div>
            <div class="m-hero">— hero —</div>
            <div class="m-grid"><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div></div>
            <div class="m-foot"><span>· · ● · ·</span><span>4 / 7</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ch-label">
          <div class="ch-name">MULTIPAGE</div>
          <div class="ch-sub">разделы · навигация · глубина</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CINEMATIC -->
      <div class="ch-tile" data-target="cinematic" onclick="window.location.search='?mode=cinematic'">
        <div class="ch-preview">
          <div class="ch-prev-cinematic">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 90 130" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">
              <polygon points="0,130 90,130 55,65 35,65" fill="#0a0d14"/>
              <polygon points="0,0 90,0 55,65 35,65" fill="#06080e"/>
              <polygon points="0,0 35,65 35,65 0,130" fill="#0a0d14"/>
              <polygon points="90,0 55,65 55,65 90,130" fill="#0a0d14"/>
              <rect x="44" y="0" width="2" height="64" fill="#ffffff" opacity="0.55"/>
              <line x1="22" y1="130" x2="38" y2="68" stroke="#ffcd6e" stroke-width="0.7" opacity="0.7"/>
              <line x1="68" y1="130" x2="52" y2="68" stroke="#ffcd6e" stroke-width="0.7" opacity="0.7"/>
              <line x1="8" y1="36" x2="33" y2="62" stroke="#ffcd6e" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.55"/>
              <line x1="82" y1="36" x2="57" y2="62" stroke="#ffcd6e" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.55"/>
              <polygon points="42,10 48,10 52,65 38,65" fill="#ffcd6e" opacity="0.10"/>
              <ellipse cx="45" cy="65" rx="9" ry="5" fill="#ffcd6e" opacity="0.45"/>
              <ellipse cx="45" cy="65" rx="20" ry="11" fill="#ffcd6e" opacity="0.10"/>
            </svg>
            <div class="label">SCENE 03 · AI VIDEO</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ch-label">
          <div class="ch-name">CINEMATIC</div>
          <div class="ch-sub">3D · кино · сцены</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ch-footer">кликни на любой формат · переходишь сразу внутрь</div>
  </div>

  <!-- "← change format" floating switch, visible in all chosen modes -->
  <a class="ch-switch" href="?" title="вернуться к выбору формата">← сменить формат</a>

  <!-- Multipage navigation strip — only shown when html.mode-multipage -->
  <nav class="mp-nav" aria-label="разделы сайта">
    <a href="#stage-0"  data-section="hero">Главная</a>
    <a href="#stage-1"  data-section="services">Услуги</a>
    <a href="#works"    data-section="works">Работы</a>
    <a href="#stage-12" data-section="pricing">Цены</a>
    <a href="#stage-14" data-section="process">Процесс</a>
    <a href="#contact"  data-section="contact">Контакты</a>
  </nav>

  <!-- Sticky bottom CTA — only shown when html.mode-landing -->
  <div class="landing-cta" aria-label="связаться">
    <div class="lc-text">
      Готовы запускать?
      <small>Ответим в течение 24 часов</small>
    </div>
    <a class="lc-btn" href="#contact">Обсудить проект</a>
  </div>

  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="brand" href="#"><span class="dot">▍</span> HYPE PRODUCTION</a>
    <div class="scene-counter"><span class="now" id="sceneNow">00</span> / <span id="sceneTotal">16</span><span style="margin-left:14px" id="sceneLabel">LAPTOP</span></div>
    <div class="header-actions">
      <div class="lang-switcher">
        <button type="button" data-lang="en">EN</button>
        <button type="button" data-lang="ru" class="active">RU</button>
        <button type="button" data-lang="uz">UZ</button>
      </div>
      <a class="header-cta" href="#contact" data-i18n="headerCta">Start project</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="scene-canvas-wrap"><canvas id="three-canvas"></canvas></div>
  <div class="vignette"></div>

  <main>
    <section class="stage left" data-stage="0"><div class="stage-inner">
      <p class="stage-eyebrow"><span class="num">00</span> <span data-i18n="s0Eyebrow">Cinematic Video Studio</span></p>
      <h2 data-i18n="s0Title">HYPE PRODUCTION</h2>
      <p class="lead" data-i18n="s0Lead">Воплощаем любые идеи в кадре. Скроль вниз — увидишь все направления студии.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn primary" href="#contact" data-i18n="ctaStart">Start a project</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="#works" data-i18n="ctaWorks">View works</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div><strong>1000+</strong><span data-i18n="statVideos">videos created</span></div>
        <div><strong>7+</strong><span data-i18n="statCompanies">companies</span></div>
        <div><strong>15</strong><span data-i18n="statBloggers">bloggers</span></div>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="stage center" data-stage="1"><div class="stage-inner">
      <p class="stage-eyebrow" style="justify-content:center"><span class="num">01</span> <span data-i18n="s1Eyebrow">Enter the studio</span></p>
      <h2 data-i18n="s1Title">8 <span class="gradient">directions.</span> One studio.</h2>
      <p class="lead" style="margin:0 auto" data-i18n="s1Lead">Каждое направление — собственная сцена. Скролль дальше.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="stage left" data-stage="2"><div class="stage-inner">
      <p class="stage-eyebrow"><span class="num">02 / CM</span> <span data-i18n="s2Eyebrow">Commercial Videos</span></p>
      <h2 class="med" data-i18n="s2Title">Built for <span class="gradient">paid media.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead" data-i18n="s2Lead">Видео высокого импакта для рекламных кампаний и запусков.</p>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="#contact" data-i18n="ctaDiscuss">Discuss project</a>
    </div></section>

    <section class="stage right" data-stage="3"><div class="stage-inner">
      <p class="stage-eyebrow" style="justify-content:flex-end"><span class="num">03 / AI</span> <span data-i18n="s3Eyebrow">AI Generated</span></p>
      <h2 class="med" data-i18n="s3Title">Concept worlds <span class="gradient">by AI.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-left:auto" data-i18n="s3Lead">Концепты, сцены и визуальные системы на основе AI.</p>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="#contact" data-i18n="ctaDiscuss">Discuss project</a>
    </div></section>

    <section class="stage left" data-stage="4"><div class="stage-inner">
      <p class="stage-eyebrow"><span class="num">04 / RL</span> <span data-i18n="s4Eyebrow">Social Media Reels</span></p>
      <h2 class="med" data-i18n="s4Title">Built for <span class="gradient">the thumb.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead" data-i18n="s4Lead">Вертикальные монтажи. Хук, удержание, пересылки.</p>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="#contact" data-i18n="ctaDiscuss">Discuss project</a>
    </div></section>

    <section class="stage center bottom" data-stage="5"><div class="stage-inner">
      <p class="stage-eyebrow" style="justify-content:center"><span class="num">05 / BR</span> <span data-i18n="s5Eyebrow">Brand Promo Films</span></p>
      <h2 class="med" data-i18n="s5Title">Premium <span class="gradient">storytelling.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead" style="margin:0 auto" data-i18n="s5Lead">Cinematic-съёмка, саунд-дизайн, цветокоррекция.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="stage right" data-stage="6"><div class="stage-inner">
      <p class="stage-eyebrow" style="justify-content:flex-end"><span class="num">06 / MD</span> <span data-i18n="s6Eyebrow">Motion Design</span></p>
      <h2 class="med" data-i18n="s6Title">Kinetic <span class="gradient">typography.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-left:auto" data-i18n="s6Lead">Титры, переходы, UI-motion, типографика в движении.</p>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="#contact" data-i18n="ctaDiscuss">Discuss project</a>
    </div></section>

    <section class="stage left" data-stage="7"><div class="stage-inner">
      <p class="stage-eyebrow"><span class="num">07 / AD</span> <span data-i18n="s7Eyebrow">Product Ads</span></p>
      <h2 class="med" data-i18n="s7Title">Clean. Focused. <span class="gradient">Converts.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead" data-i18n="s7Lead">Продуктовая реклама для воронок и запусков.</p>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="#contact" data-i18n="ctaDiscuss">Discuss project</a>
    </div></section>

    <section class="stage center" data-stage="8"><div class="stage-inner">
      <p class="stage-eyebrow" style="justify-content:center"><span class="num">08 / WB</span> <span data-i18n="s8Eyebrow">New service</span></p>
      <h2 data-i18n="s8Title">We build <span class="gradient">sites too.</span></h2>
